{"reviewId": "290006178_80sqI0cJs", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "Deepseek大白话版：就像一个人突然拆掉家里的围墙（资本管制）和门锁（汇率管理），如果还没装好监控摄像头（金融监管）和防盗系统（风险应对机制），小偷（国际投机资本）可能随时进来洗劫一空。\n现实案例参考： 1997年亚洲金融危机：泰国过早开放资本账户，被索罗斯等对冲基金狙击泰铢，导致货币崩盘、经济衰退。\n金融开放需要与监管能力匹配，否则可能成为被国际资本攻击的“死穴”。中国目前采取渐进式开放（如沪港通、债券通），正是为了平衡风险与机遇。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "11128-11198", "abstract": "如果在不远的将来，中国在强大的国际政治压力下真的实行浮动汇率和开放资本账户，中国经济体制监控方面的弱点可以成为直接威胁中国国家经济安全的死穴", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 7, "reviewId": "290006178_80sqI0cJs", "userVid": 290006178, "topics": [], "createTime": 1748335721, "userEditTime": 1748335847, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 7, "chapterTitle": "02 繁荣的起点 工业化转型期的投资全景", "author": {"userVid": 290006178, "name": "yyds", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0007-AqDafFhKTQQoe2oNxRSWEeb/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "yyds", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "只需真实，不必完美", "medalInfo": {"id": "M8-202412-40", "desc": "每月阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读月", "levelIndex": 40}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 93, "likes": [{"userVid": 414458585, "name": "🌲", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0002-qHEk9NbwnipEQVkzI37JJ10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-100", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 100}}], "commentsCount": 2, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "AI老师这个举例不错，浅显易懂", "reviewId": "290006178_80sqI0cJs", "commentI